<view class="settings-page">
  <text class="eyebrow">DOVELIN · 服务小区</text><view class="page-title">在附近，被安心找到</view><view class="description">地图只展示你确认公开的服务小区，所有同小区宠托师使用同一个公共参考点，不展示家庭位置或实时行踪。</view>
  <view class="settings-card"><view class="card-title">当前展示</view><view class="current-name">{{profile.publicMapEnabled ? profile.publicServiceCommunityName : '尚未开启地图展示'}}</view><view class="description">{{profile.publicBookingNeedsConfirmation ? '固定服务地址或半径已修改，请重新确认公开小区及预约范围' : (profile.publicMapEnabled ? '地图展示状态仍需满足接单资格及小区有效性' : '开启后，用户可以从地图查看资料并指定预约')}}</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{profile.publicMapEnabled}}" bindtap="disable" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">停止地图展示</button></view>
  <view class="settings-card"><view class="card-title">附近推荐驻点</view><view class="description">服务城市：{{profile.serviceCity || '请先完善认证资料'}}。已按你的固定服务地址推荐附近可选小区，选择并确认即可。未收录的小区由平台在待处理清单中补充。</view><view class="search-row"><input placeholder="在附近推荐中搜索" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search" maxlength="60" disabled="{{busy || loadingProfile}}" /><button class="search-btn" bindtap="search" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{busy || loadingProfile}}">搜索</button></view>
    <view class="community-option {{selected._id === item._id ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{communities}}" wx:key="_id" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="select"><view class="option-copy"><view class="option-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="description">{{item.city}} {{item.district}}</view></view><text class="option-check">{{selected._id === item._id ? '✓' : '○'}}</text></view>
    <view class="description" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">重试</button></view><view class="description" wx:elif="{{!loading && !loadingProfile && !communities.length}}">附近尚无符合条件的小区，请联系平台补充或核对固定服务地址。</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{hasMore && !error}}" bindtap="more" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading || busy}}">查看更多附近小区</button>
  </view>
  <view class="settings-card" wx:if="{{selected}}"><view class="card-title">确认公开 {{selected.name}}</view><view class="description">对外指定预约以该小区公共参考点为服务范围中心，沿用你当前的 {{profile.serviceRadiusKm || 5}} 公里半径。家庭地址保持私密，实际接单仍需定位验证。</view><view class="consent" bindtap="confirm">{{confirmed ? '☑' : '☐'}} 我确认该小区是我的服务驻点，并同意公开小区及上述预约范围</view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{!confirmed || busy}}">确认并开启展示</button></view>
</view>
